      "review_summary": "The branch widens the Codex app-server run-attempt cleanup try/finally to cover post-turn-accept setup, types the cleanup handle for reply-backend and embedded-run use, and adds an attachBackend failure injection test.\n\nPR surface: Source +13, Tests +36. Total +49 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection on current main shows post-turn-accept resources are acquired before the cleanup finally that releases them; I did not run a live failing Codex attempt in this read-only review.",
